    "Terrain": "地形",
    "Thanks to the statistical cookies provided by ourselves and other companies, we can evaluate the visit on our website and know the sources of traffic. Data we obtain help us understand what visitors like and improve our website. If you reject them, we cannot improve your experience.": "由于我们自己和其他公司提供的统计 cookie，我们可以评估对我们网站的访问并了解流量来源。我们获得的数据有助于我们了解访问者的喜好并改进我们的网站。 如果您拒绝它们，我们将无法改善您的体验。",
    "The MRD method (beginner) is allowed when danger is 3 maximum. Choose another method: MRE or MRP.": "当危险等级最大为3时，允许使用MRD方法（初学者）。选择另一种方法：MRE或MRP。",
    "The hazard potential is calculated from the danger level of the avalanche bulletin. It can be fine-tuned by selecting a potential within the danger level’s corresponding range. For example: the avalanche bulletin evokes a danger 3 just after a period in danger 4. We can then indicate a hazard potential of 12 instead of 8.": "潜在危险是根据雪崩公告的危险等级计算出来的。可以通过选择危险等级对应范围内的危险高低进行微调。例如：雪崩公告在危险等级4后立即变为危险等级3。然后我们可以表明潜在危险为12而不是8。",
    "The page you are looking for does not exist or is broken.": "您查找的页面不存在或已损坏。",
    "The slope must be between 0 and 80 deg": "坡度必须在0到80度之间",
    "The slope must be between 50 and 3000m high": "坡高必须在50到3000米之间",
    "The “slope traveled frequently” factor is not taken into account by the application, as it is often difficult to ascertain when preparing for an outing.": "该应用没有考虑“经常经过的坡道”因素，因为在准备出行时通常很难确定。",
    "There are sensitive areas on this route. Please refer to the map.": "这条路线上有敏感区域。请参考地图。",
    "These are positive experiences that reveal usefull risk-management skills.": "这些积极的经验展现了有用的风险管理技能。",
    "These cookies allow you to interact from camptocamp.org website with social media modules and share content of the website with other people or let them know of your consultation or opinion on it, e.g. when you click on the &quot;Share&quot; module. By disabling these cookies, you won't be able to share content from camptocamp.org on social networks.": "这些 cookie 允许您从 camptocamp.org 网站与社交媒体模块进行交互，并与其他人分享网站内容或让他们知道您的参考或意见，例如，当您点击&quot;分享&quot;模块时。禁用这些 cookie，您将无法在社交网络上分享来自 camptocamp.org 的内容。",
